                                "sense_id": "6263d148-3b90-3842-9a7a-bb739e1b7d18",
                                "text": "[A] preliminary caucus was held, \"a sort of dodge on the sly\", a closed door affair, at the Executive mansion, to \"settle the hash\" of those who might be tender-footed or disposed to bolt, and to pizzle them into arrangements."
                            },
